) VALUES (
    'the-streif-kitzbuehel-history',
    '{"en": "The Streif: The World''s Most Fearsome Downhill Course", "de": "Die Streif: Die furchteinflößendste Abfahrt der Welt", "fr": "Le Streif : La descente la plus redoutable du monde", "it": "Lo Streif: La discesa più temuta del mondo", "es": "El Streif: La bajada más temible del mundo", "pt": "O Streif: A descida mais temível do mundo", "nl": "De Streif: De meest gevreesde afdaling ter wereld", "ar": "ستريف: أخطر منحدر تزلج في العالم", "ja": "シュトライフ：世界で最も恐ろしいダウンヒルコース", "zh": "Streif: Shijie Shang Zuikongbu de Huajiang Saidao", "ko": "슈트라이프: 세계에서 가장 무서운 활강 코스"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "The Streif at Kitzbühel is alpine skiing''s ultimate test. This Austrian course demands courage, skill, and respect in equal measure from the world''s best downhill racers.", "de": "Die Streif in Kitzbühel ist der ultimative Test im alpinen Skifahren. Diese österreichische Strecke verlangt Mut, Können und Respekt gleichermaßen.", "fr": "Le Streif à Kitzbühel est le test ultime du ski alpin. Ce parcours autrichien exige courage, habileté et respect en parts égales.", "it": "Lo Streif a Kitzbühel è il test definitivo dello sci alpino. Questo percorso austriaco richiede coraggio, abilità e rispetto in egual misura.", "es": "El Streif en Kitzbühel es la prueba definitiva del esquí alpino. Este recorrido austríaco exige coraje, habilidad y respeto en partes iguales.", "pt": "O Streif em Kitzbühel é o teste definitivo do esqui alpino. Este percurso austríaco exige coragem, habilidade e respeito em medidas iguais.", "nl": "De Streif in Kitzbühel is de ultieme test in alpine skiën. Dit Oostenrijkse parcours vereist moed, vaardigheid en respect in gelijke mate.", "ar": "ستريف في كيتزبوهيل هو الاختبار النهائي للتزلج الألبي. يتطلب هذا المسار النمساوي الشجاعة والمهارة والاحترام بالتساوي", "ja": "キッツビュールのシュトライフは、アルペンスキーの究極のテストです。このオーストリアのコースは、世界最高のダウンヒルレーサーに勇気、技術、そして敬意を等しく要求します。", "zh": "Kitzbuehel de Streif shi gaoshan huaxue de zhongji kaoyan. Zhe ge Aodili saidao yaoqiu yongqi, jineng he zunzhong.", "ko": "키츠뷔엘의 슈트라이프는 알파인 스키의 궁극적인 테스트입니다. 이 오스트리아 코스는 용기, 기술, 그리고 존경을 동등하게 요구합니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>The <a href=\"/kitzbuehel-venue-guide/\">Streif at Kitzbühel</a> stands alone in <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">alpine skiing</a>. This is the race every downhill skier dreams of winning and fears in equal measure. It is, quite simply, the most famous and demanding downhill course in the world.</p><h2>The Numbers</h2><p>The Streif drops 860 meters over 3.3 kilometers, averaging a 27% gradient. But those statistics hide the truth. Some sections approach 85% gradient—nearly vertical. Athletes reach speeds over 140 km/h while negotiating terrain that would stop most skiers cold.</p><p>The Hahnenkamm race typically lasts under two minutes, but those 120 seconds can define careers or end them.</p><h2>The Sections</h2><p><strong>Mausefalle (Mousetrap):</strong> The course begins with an 85% drop, one of the steepest race sections anywhere. Athletes are essentially in freefall before the first turn.</p><p><strong>Steilhang:</strong> A brutally steep face where athletes must maintain edge control while accelerating. The compression at the bottom tests every joint.</p><p><strong>Alte Schneise:</strong> High-speed gliding where aerodynamic position determines advantage.</p><p><strong>Seidlalm Jump:</strong> Athletes launch 80+ meters through the air before landing on a transition that hammers legs.</p><p><strong>Traverse:</strong> A relatively flat section where athletes recover before the final push.</p><p><strong>Hausbergkante:</strong> The final steep section before the finish, where legs burning from fatigue must still find edge grip.</p><h2>The Atmosphere</h2><p>The Hahnenkamm weekend transforms Kitzbühel. Over 100,000 spectators crowd the course, creating an atmosphere unlike any other ski race. The town becomes a festival of skiing, with celebrities, former champions, and dedicated fans gathering to witness the spectacle.</p><p>Austrian TV draws millions of viewers. Winning here means instant national hero status.</p><h2>The Legends</h2><p>Winning the Streif once is exceptional. Winning it multiple times is legendary. Franz Klammer''s 1976 run remains one of the most celebrated moments in skiing history. Didier Cuche won five times. Karl Schranz, Josef Strobl, and Fritz Strobl have all conquered this mountain.</p><p>Modern champions like <a href=\"/vincent-kriechmayr-profile/\">Vincent Kriechmayr</a> have added their names to the honor roll of Streif victors.</p><h2>The Dangers</h2><p>The Streif has claimed its share of victims. Horrific crashes have ended careers and caused life-changing injuries. Every racer who starts respects what the mountain can do.</p><p>Yet they return, year after year, drawn by the challenge and the glory that comes with conquering skiing''s ultimate test.</p><h2>The Future</h2><p>As technology advances and athletes push harder, the Streif continues to evolve. Safety improvements protect racers without diminishing the challenge. The Hahnenkamm remains what it has always been: the pinnacle of downhill racing.</p>", "de": "<p>Die <a href=\"/kitzbuehel-venue-guide/\">Streif in Kitzbühel</a> steht allein im <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">alpinen Skifahren</a>. Dies ist das Rennen, von dem jeder Abfahrer träumt und das er gleichermaßen fürchtet.</p><h2>Die Zahlen</h2><p>Die Streif fällt 860 Meter über 3,3 Kilometer ab, mit einem durchschnittlichen Gefälle von 27%. Einige Abschnitte erreichen 85% Gefälle—nahezu vertikal.</p><h2>Die Abschnitte</h2><p><strong>Mausefalle:</strong> Die Strecke beginnt mit einem 85%-Gefälle, einer der steilsten Rennabschnitte überhaupt.</p><h2>Die Legenden</h2><p>Franz Klammers Fahrt 1976 bleibt einer der gefeiertsten Momente der Ski-Geschichte. Moderne Champions wie <a href=\"/vincent-kriechmayr-profile/\">Vincent Kriechmayr</a> haben ihre Namen hinzugefügt.</p>", "fr": "<p>Le <a href=\"/kitzbuehel-venue-guide/\">Streif à Kitzbühel</a> est unique dans le <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">ski alpin</a>. C''est la course dont chaque descendeur rêve de gagner et qu''il craint à parts égales.</p><h2>Les chiffres</h2><p>Le Streif descend de 860 mètres sur 3,3 kilomètres, avec une pente moyenne de 27%. Certaines sections atteignent 85%—presque vertical.</p><h2>Les sections</h2><p><strong>Mausefalle:</strong> Le parcours commence par une chute de 85%, l''une des sections de course les plus raides.</p><h2>Les légendes</h2><p>Des champions modernes comme <a href=\"/vincent-kriechmayr-profile/\">Vincent Kriechmayr</a> ont ajouté leurs noms au palmarès.</p>", "it": "<p>Lo <a href=\"/kitzbuehel-venue-guide/\">Streif a Kitzbühel</a> è unico nello <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">sci alpino</a>. Questa è la gara che ogni discesista sogna di vincere e teme in egual misura.</p><h2>I numeri</h2><p>Lo Streif scende di 860 metri su 3,3 chilometri, con una pendenza media del 27%. Alcune sezioni raggiungono l''85%—quasi verticale.</p><h2>Le sezioni</h2><p><strong>Mausefalle:</strong> Il percorso inizia con una discesa dell''85%, una delle sezioni di gara più ripide.</p><h2>Le leggende</h2><p>Campioni moderni come <a href=\"/vincent-kriechmayr-profile/\">Vincent Kriechmayr</a> hanno aggiunto i loro nomi all''albo d''oro.</p>", "es": "<p>El <a href=\"/kitzbuehel-venue-guide/\">Streif en Kitzbühel</a> es único en el <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">esquí alpino</a>.</p><h2>Los números</h2><p>El Streif desciende 860 metros en 3,3 kilómetros, con una pendiente promedio del 27%.</p>", "pt": "<p>O <a href=\"/kitzbuehel-venue-guide/\">Streif em Kitzbühel</a> é único no <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">esqui alpino</a>.</p><h2>Os números</h2><p>O Streif desce 860 metros em 3,3 quilômetros, com uma inclinação média de 27%.</p>", "nl": "<p>De <a href=\"/kitzbuehel-venue-guide/\">Streif in Kitzbühel</a> is uniek in <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">alpine skiën</a>.</p><h2>De cijfers</h2><p>De Streif daalt 860 meter over 3,3 kilometer, met een gemiddelde helling van 27%.</p>", "ar": "<p><a href=\"/kitzbuehel-venue-guide/\">ستريف في كيتزبوهيل</a> فريد من نوعه في <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">التزلج الألبي</a>.</p><h2>الأرقام</h2><p>ينخفض ستريف 860 متراً على مسافة 3.3 كيلومتر، بمتوسط انحدار 27%.</p>", "ja": "<p><a href=\"/kitzbuehel-venue-guide/\">キッツビュールのシュトライフ</a>は<a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">アルペンスキー</a>において唯一無二です。</p><h2>数字</h2><p>シュトライフは3.3キロメートルで860メートル下降し、平均勾配は27%です。</p>", "zh": "<p><a href=\"/kitzbuehel-venue-guide/\">Kitzbuehel de Streif</a> zai <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">gaoshan huaxue</a> zhong duyi wuer.</p><h2>Shuzi</h2><p>Streif zai 3.3 gongli nei xia jiang 860 mi, pingjun podu wei 27%.</p>", "ko": "<p><a href=\"/kitzbuehel-venue-guide/\">키츠뷔엘의 슈트라이프</a>는 <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">알파인 스키</a>에서 독보적입니다.</p><h2>숫자</h2><p>슈트라이프는 3.3킬로미터에 걸쳐 860미터를 하강하며, 평균 경사도는 27%입니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'historical',
    'AS',
    '{"en": "The Streif at Kitzbühel - History of alpine skiing''s most famous and demanding downhill course, the ultimate test for World Cup racers.", "de": "Die Streif in Kitzbühel - Geschichte der berühmtesten und anspruchsvollsten Abfahrt im alpinen Skifahren.", "fr": "Le Streif à Kitzbühel - Histoire de la descente la plus célèbre et exigeante du ski alpin.", "it": "Lo Streif a Kitzbühel - Storia della discesa più famosa e impegnativa dello sci alpino.", "es": "El Streif en Kitzbühel - Historia de la bajada más famosa y exigente del esquí alpino.", "pt": "O Streif em Kitzbühel - História da descida mais famosa e exigente do esqui alpino.", "nl": "De Streif in Kitzbühel - Geschiedenis van de beroemdste en meest veeleisende afdaling in alpine skiën.", "ar": "ستريف في كيتزبوهيل - تاريخ أشهر وأصعب منحدر في التزلج الألبي", "ja": "キッツビュールのシュトライフ - アルペンスキーで最も有名で厳しいダウンヒルコースの歴史", "zh": "Kitzbuehel de Streif - Gaoshan huaxue zhong zuizhuming he zuiyangede huajiang saidao de lishi", "ko": "키츠뷔엘의 슈트라이프 - 알파인 스키에서 가장 유명하고 까다로운 활강 코스의 역사"}'::jsonb,
